recommend keep-going ALES28 — let the graft or paste join rather than butt by default (an edit that crossfades its seams when they would step), name a trailing-seam law where the audio after an insert rejoins the timeline, or a multi-slot clipboard rack. The wire seam and the real sound-card write stay Keaton's word.
